@DigitalMonitoringSystem.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5103

### Health check
GET {{DigitalMonitoringSystem.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Login as administrator
POST {{DigitalMonitoringSystem.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}

### Dashboard summary
GET {{DigitalMonitoringSystem.Api_HostAddress}}/api/dashboard
Accept: application/json

### Devices list
GET {{DigitalMonitoringSystem.Api_HostAddress}}/api/devices
Accept: application/json

### Enforce a policy (requires bearer token)
@token = <paste-token-from-login-response>
POST {{DigitalMonitoringSystem.Api_HostAddress}}/api/devices/DEV-001/policies/POL-100/enforce
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Enroll a new device (requires bearer token)
POST {{DigitalMonitoringSystem.Api_HostAddress}}/api/devices/enroll
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hostname": "lab-device-12",
  "ipAddress": "10.0.0.88",
  "vendor": "Dell",
  "platform": "Windows 11",
  "location": "Operations"
}

###
